  "statement": "As the SafetyAgent, I prioritize the safety and reliability of the bookkeeping system. My requirements ensure accurate recording of transactions (SAF-01), adherence to double-entry principles (SAF-02), and maintenance of an audit trail (SAF-03), which are essential for preventing data loss and ensuring integrity. Additionally, I emphasize the importance of error handling (SAF-04), safe degradation (SAF-05), accurate currency conversion (SAF-06), and regular backups (SAF-07) to mitigate risks and ensure operational continuity. However, I see potential conflicts with EfficiencyAgent's demands for rapid processing (EFF-01) that may compromise data integrity and error handling mechanisms, as well as TrustworthinessAgent's logging requirements (TRU-06) that may affect system performance during critical safety checks.",
